{"id":"n81344-6-3","stage":5,"title":"톡톡히 · 充实地","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n81344-6-3-1","ko":"어제 행사에서 말이야. 유명 가수의 공연 덕분에 분위기가 아주 좋았어.","zh":"昨天在活动上的时候啊，多亏了那位知名歌手的演出，现场气氛非常好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日。","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"행사에서","meaning":"活动，仪式，典礼","explanation":"행사：活动，仪式，典礼；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"행사","audio":"/audio/9fbe110d36cda8cf2d98.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72482","senseId":"1","lemma":"행사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"행사에서","audio":"/audio/08c92bc4e74a18a1dcf0.mp3"}},{"text":"말이야.","meaning":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","explanation":"말：表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"11","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말이야","audio":"/audio/fd5a3f00cd7342725148.mp3"}},{"text":"유명","meaning":"有名，知名，著名","explanation":"유명：有名，知名，著名。","readings":[{"term":"유명","audio":"/audio/ea0d5715f8bc89bcedd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70383","senseId":"1","lemma":"유명","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유명","audio":"/audio/ea0d5715f8bc89bcedd8.mp3"}},{"text":"가수의","meaning":"歌手","explanation":"가수：歌手；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"가수","audio":"/audio/9e173c93773cc5589668.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62256","senseId":"1","lemma":"가수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가수의","audio":"/audio/21ab5b4545f97dc86c45.mp3"}},{"text":"공연","meaning":"演出，表演","explanation":"공연：演出，表演。","readings":[{"term":"공연","audio":"/audio/1c3a0a24ef01c77b9620.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62459","senseId":"1","lemma":"공연","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공연","audio":"/audio/1c3a0a24ef01c77b9620.mp3"}},{"text":"덕분에","meaning":"托福，关怀，恩德","explanation":"덕분：托福，关怀，恩德；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"덕분","audio":"/audio/4863a9a8be42033e7d79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47410","senseId":"1","lemma":"덕분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"덕분에","audio":"/audio/b018e6ffb125d6c10a69.mp3"}},{"text":"분위기가","meaning":"气氛，氛围","explanation":"분위기：气氛，氛围；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"분위기","audio":"/audio/b0d7b29bb8fee6469928.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65855","senseId":"1","lemma":"분위기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"분위기가","audio":"/audio/aeafae1134479b98bf89.mp3"}},{"text":"아주","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"아주：非常，极其，很。","readings":[{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72484","senseId":"1","lemma":"아주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}},{"text":"좋았어.","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋았어","audio":"/audio/cd6dc803ada138294ae4.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"9fbe110d36cda8cf","term":"행사","zh":"活动，仪式，典礼","audio":"/audio/9fbe110d36cda8cf2d98.mp3","entryId":"72482","definition":"有目的或计划地按程序做某事；或指该事。","pronunciation":["행사"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"ea0d5715f8bc89bc","term":"유명","zh":"有名，知名，著名","audio":"/audio/ea0d5715f8bc89bcedd8.mp3","entryId":"70383","definition":"名字广为人知。","pronunciation":["유ː명"]},{"id":"9e173c93773cc558","term":"가수","zh":"歌手","audio":"/audio/9e173c93773cc5589668.mp3","entryId":"62256","definition":"以唱歌为职业的人。","pronunciation":["가수"]},{"id":"1c3a0a24ef01c77b","term":"공연","zh":"演出，表演","audio":"/audio/1c3a0a24ef01c77b9620.mp3","entryId":"62459","definition":"将歌曲、舞蹈、戏剧等展现给观众。","pronunciation":["공연"]},{"id":"4863a9a8be42033e","term":"덕분","zh":"托福，关怀，恩德","audio":"/audio/4863a9a8be42033e7d79.mp3","entryId":"47410","definition":"某人给予的关照或帮助；或某事发生后带来的好处。","pronunciation":["덕뿐"]},{"id":"b0d7b29bb8fee646","term":"분위기","zh":"气氛，氛围","audio":"/audio/b0d7b29bb8fee6469928.mp3","entryId":"65855","definition":"在某个场合或场面获得的感受。","pronunciation":["부뉘기"]},{"id":"dc76f888ddfaef28","term":"아주","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3","entryId":"72484","definition":"表示程度相当高，远远超出了一般程度。","pronunciation":["아주"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，美，优良，优美","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"性质或内容等很优秀，让人满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/70bbe1911d579425d863.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n81344-6-3-2","ko":"역시나 이름값을 톡톡히 해낸 거지.","zh":"果然名不虚传啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"역시나","meaning":"果然","explanation":"역시：果然；나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"역시","audio":"/audio/112d19723c425ab6813b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67372","senseId":"2","lemma":"역시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"역시나","audio":"/audio/ebdb735402e743b88181.mp3"}},{"text":"이름값을","meaning":"名副其实的言行","explanation":"이름값：名副其实的言行；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"이름값","audio":"/audio/8413ea074c794799b94a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72047","senseId":"1","lemma":"이름값","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이름값을","audio":"/audio/f190f0852afba6c62b68.mp3"}},{"text":"톡톡히","meaning":"充实地","explanation":"톡톡히：充实地。","readings":[{"term":"톡톡히","audio":"/audio/997424bcba488a5b04df.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81344","senseId":"6","lemma":"톡톡히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"톡톡히","audio":"/audio/997424bcba488a5b04df.mp3"}},{"text":"해낸","meaning":"做到，做成，完成，搞定","explanation":"해내다：做到，做成，完成，搞定；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"해내다","audio":"/audio/58c2c4533541e837bcd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85144","senseId":"2","lemma":"해내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해낸","audio":"/audio/ffc119a07299dfe95173.mp3"}},{"text":"거지.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거지","audio":"/audio/a9e973ff709d931a2b92.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"112d19723c425ab6","term":"역시","zh":"果然","audio":"/audio/112d19723c425ab6813b.mp3","entryId":"67372","definition":"和所想的一样。","pronunciation":["역씨"]},{"id":"8413ea074c794799","term":"이름값","zh":"名副其实的言行","audio":"/audio/8413ea074c794799b94a.mp3","entryId":"72047","definition":"与自己的地位或名声相符的行为。","pronunciation":["이름깝"]},{"id":"997424bcba488a5b","term":"톡톡히","zh":"充实地","audio":"/audio/997424bcba488a5b04df.mp3","entryId":"81344","definition":"所承担的责任或作用等顺利、充分地","pronunciation":["톡토키"]},{"id":"58c2c4533541e837","term":"해내다","zh":"做到，做成，完成，搞定","audio":"/audio/58c2c4533541e837bcd1.mp3","entryId":"85144","definition":"很好地处理自己负责或遇到的事情。","pronunciation":["해ː내다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/77b2975be0b3782dda1c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.447,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/Sear